<title>USA: HydroChem to issue $100 mln in 10-yr 144A notes.</title>
<headline>HydroChem to issue $100 mln in 10-yr 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>HydroChem Industrial Services Inc will issue $100 million in 10-year senior subordinated notes in a 144A private placement offering, according to a confidential prospectus.</p>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp is listed as sole manager for the issue.</p>
<p>HydroChem Industrial Services, based in Houston, Texas, is a wholly-owned subsidiary of HydroChem Holding Inc.</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1672))</p>
</text>
